{#
  Bill Pay — Scene accordion. Exploratory, third instance of the
  scene-gallery pattern (see scene-gallery.njk / scene-gallery-2.njk
  for the first two) — built for a side-by-side visual comparison
  against Gallery 2: same content (tag, caption, Barnett Lawn Care
  drawer-open mock), a two-panel width-swap accordion instead of a
  slide. Does not modify or share code with Gallery 1's or Gallery 2's
  files — this may be deleted after comparison.

  Entire visual composition (panels, tag, caption, mock, width
  transition) lives inside
  assets/scene-gallery/bill-pay/scenes-accordion.html — this partial
  only provides the iframe stage (sized to the page's own 800px content
  column by scene-accordion.css, no viewport bleed) and the shared
  progress row.

  Standalone component — no section wrapper, no headline, no
  background. Caller drops {{ sceneAccordion() }} into its own content
  column.
#}
{% from "gallery-navigation.njk" import galleryInteraction %}

{% macro sceneAccordion() %}
<div class="scene-accordion">
  <div class="scene-accordion__stage">
    <iframe class="scene-accordion__visual" id="scene-accordion-visual" title="Bill Pay scene (accordion)"></iframe>
  </div>
  <div class="scene-accordion__navigation">
    {{ galleryInteraction("scene-accordion") }}
  </div>
</div>
{% endmacro %}
